"用來讀 Slack、Discord，以及 Messenger、Instagram、Threads 網頁版的對話，並把你選的回覆填進輸入框。瀏覽器裡只讀這三個網站的訊息頁，以及你正在 Instagram、Threads 留言回覆的那篇貼文，其他網頁不讀。在清單裡把 Wingman 打開，這裡會自動打勾。Wingman 只讀你正在看的對話，不會自動送出任何訊息。" = "Reads Slack and Discord conversations, and Messenger, Instagram and Threads on the web, and fills in the reply you pick. In a browser only those three sites' message pages are read, plus the Instagram or Threads post you are writing a reply under; no other page. Turn Wingman on in the list and this ticks itself. Wingman only reads the conversation in front of you and never sends anything on its own.";
