"這兩個 App 不提供文字給其他程式讀，所以 Wingman 只截它們的視窗、在這台 Mac 上辨識文字，截圖不會上傳。開啟後要重新啟動 Wingman 才會生效。" = "These two apps don't expose their text to other programs, so Wingman captures only their window and reads it on this Mac. Captures are never uploaded. Restart Wingman after turning this on.";
