"填好 key 後按「測試連線」，確認都能用。" = "After entering the keys, press Test Connection to check them.";
"key 只存在這台 Mac 的鑰匙圈，只會送到它所屬的服務。" = "Keys stay in this Mac's Keychain and go only to the service they belong to.";
"2. 連上 AI" = "2. Connect the AI";
"用來分辨 Slack、Discord 裡哪些訊息是你說的。各 App 顯示的名字不同時，用逗號分開，例如「Yii, Yii Chen」。LINE、Telegram 和網頁版的 Messenger、Instagram、Threads 看氣泡位置，不需要名字。" = "Tells your Slack and Discord messages apart from others'. If apps show different names, separate them with commas, e.g. \"Yii, Yii Chen\". LINE, Telegram, and Messenger, Instagram and Threads on the web go by bubble position and need no name.";
"3. 你是誰" = "3. Who you are";
"Wingman 沒有自己的伺服器，開發者收不到你的 key，也收不到聊天內容。" = "Wingman has no server of its own: its developer never receives your keys or your chats.";
"送出去的只有你正在看的對話裡最近 20 則訊息、聊天室名稱和發言人名字：判斷送到 TypeSafe（承諾不拿來訓練模型），寫回覆送到 OpenRouter，而且只轉給不保留、不訓練的供應商。聊天內容預設不會存在這台 Mac 上：Wingman 開著時只在記憶體裡記得你看過的訊息，讓往上捲過的內容也算數，關掉就消失；除非你打開下面的「記住聊天紀錄」。紀錄檔只記時間、次數和花費。" = "Only the last 20 messages of the chat you're looking at, the chat's name and the senders' names are sent: judgments to TypeSafe (which commits not to train on them), drafts to OpenRouter, routed only to providers that neither keep nor train on them. By default chats are never stored on this Mac: while Wingman runs it remembers the messages you have seen in memory only, so ones you scrolled past still count, and forgets them when it quits; unless you turn on Remember chats below. The log keeps only times, counts and costs.";
"OpenRouter 隱私政策 ↗" = "OpenRouter privacy policy ↗";
