"開啟後，每個聊天室最近 300 則訊息會加密存在這台 Mac（不進備份，90 天沒打開就刪除），下次打開時也記得之前說過的話；送出去的仍然只有最近 20 則。關掉會立刻刪除已存的紀錄。" = "When on, each chat's last 300 messages are kept encrypted on this Mac (out of backups, deleted after 90 days unopened), so reopening a chat keeps what was said before; only the last 20 are ever sent. Turning it off deletes what was kept right away.";
